{
  "bvid": "BV1H7JTzXEEd",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "3865fc702dc3378b832e15203f10a4ceed88bca21c6ed2068d69b33d8af280d7",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 80,
      "end_ms": 3320,
      "text": "首先要做的不是群众工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 3960,
      "end_ms": 9040,
      "text": "或者说首先你没有足够的合格的人手"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 9040,
      "end_ms": 11440,
      "text": "做所谓的群众工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 13020,
      "end_ms": 15180,
      "text": "首先要做的是职业革命家的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 16740,
      "end_ms": 21550,
      "text": "或者或者说我们一直说的那个词叫sees the car"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 21550,
      "end_ms": 27010,
      "text": "首先要做的是那些不合格的活动者的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 27010,
      "end_ms": 28660,
      "text": "他们不合格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 28660,
      "end_ms": 30100,
      "text": "要让他们合格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 30100,
      "end_ms": 31380,
      "text": "勉强让他们合格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 31380,
      "end_ms": 36050,
      "text": "但是呢他可能在其他方面已经合格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 36050,
      "end_ms": 38130,
      "text": "就差一两门不合格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 38130,
      "end_ms": 41800,
      "text": "这个工作容易得多"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 42120,
      "end_ms": 45480,
      "text": "所以首先要做的是找那些"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 46570,
      "end_ms": 49370,
      "text": "其他很多方面已经合格了的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 49539,
      "end_ms": 52459,
      "text": "就剩一两个方面不太合格的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 52459,
      "end_ms": 54779,
      "text": "而这一两个方面不合格的方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 54779,
      "end_ms": 62090,
      "text": "可以在短时间之内一次两次三次四次比较呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 62090,
      "end_ms": 67830,
      "text": "慎重的正式的活动下就能给他把短板补齐的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 68830,
      "end_ms": 70210,
      "text": "要做这些人的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 70210,
      "end_ms": 74440,
      "text": "那么他主要的那些合格的部分是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 74440,
      "end_ms": 77060,
      "text": "他受教育水平是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 77060,
      "end_ms": 82390,
      "text": "是他的一定程度的啊否定性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 82390,
      "end_ms": 84430,
      "text": "一定程度的这种否定性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 84430,
      "end_ms": 86669,
      "text": "内在内核的否定性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 86669,
      "end_ms": 88589,
      "text": "那么那个短板是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 88589,
      "end_ms": 89909,
      "text": "短板是他的右肢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 89909,
      "end_ms": 94950,
      "text": "短板是他的对于一些客观状况的无知"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 94950,
      "end_ms": 99940,
      "text": "短板是他的一些还没有幻想没有掐掉啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 99940,
      "end_ms": 101680,
      "text": "这些幻想是容易掐灭的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 101680,
      "end_ms": 104520,
      "text": "在现实的这个火花下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 104520,
      "end_ms": 107040,
      "text": "这个冰水一下子就会啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 107040,
      "end_ms": 108440,
      "text": "不是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 108440,
      "end_ms": 111320,
      "text": "在这雪花一下子就会被融化掉啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 111320,
      "end_ms": 113840,
      "text": "这种幻想唉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 113840,
      "end_ms": 115960,
      "text": "很多人说我们不近人情啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 115960,
      "end_ms": 118150,
      "text": "门槛高啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 118150,
      "end_ms": 120350,
      "text": "我们门槛不高"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 120350,
      "end_ms": 122470,
      "text": "但我们正儿八经做事情的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 122470,
      "end_ms": 125059,
      "text": "门槛我们不会对大众啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 125059,
      "end_ms": 127299,
      "text": "对所谓群众有什么偏见"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 127299,
      "end_ms": 129500,
      "text": "或者有什么瞧不起的地方"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 129780,
      "end_ms": 133880,
      "text": "但是是很客观审慎冷静的看待这个事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 133880,
      "end_ms": 136260,
      "text": "我们首要做的工作呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 139780,
      "end_ms": 141380,
      "text": "不是泛滥"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 141380,
      "end_ms": 142360,
      "text": "我们的爱心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 142360,
      "end_ms": 147459,
      "text": "把群众当成一个道德欲拯救欲发泄的对象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 147539,
      "end_ms": 149299,
      "text": "没有任何意义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 149299,
      "end_ms": 152360,
      "text": "首先就是要有门槛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 152360,
      "end_ms": 156720,
      "text": "这个门槛是智性的门槛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 156720,
      "end_ms": 161140,
      "text": "是情感关怀的门槛是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 161140,
      "end_ms": 170390,
      "text": "基本的学养和基本的学习习惯能力的一个门槛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 170730,
      "end_ms": 174150,
      "text": "你这个门槛不是说都是小资"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 174150,
      "end_ms": 176050,
      "text": "之前有一个跟我们连麦的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 176050,
      "end_ms": 178590,
      "text": "在地下室里面住了好几年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 178590,
      "end_ms": 181189,
      "text": "咳咳他也是个打工的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 181189,
      "end_ms": 181949,
      "text": "无产者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 181949,
      "end_ms": 183669,
      "text": "后厨帮工的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 183669,
      "end_ms": 186830,
      "text": "但他自己靠自学啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 186830,
      "end_ms": 187730,
      "text": "靠努力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 187730,
      "end_ms": 192310,
      "text": "他被我说是不是类似斯大林这么一个人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 194180,
      "end_ms": 195720,
      "text": "他不也过来了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 195720,
      "end_ms": 197300,
      "text": "他不也合格了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 197300,
      "end_ms": 199819,
      "text": "甚至在我眼里是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 199819,
      "end_ms": 201639,
      "text": "有一定概率可能是优秀啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 201639,
      "end_ms": 204039,
      "text": "到底怎样就要考察一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 204640,
      "end_ms": 207560,
      "text": "直接做所谓的群众工作有用吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 207560,
      "end_ms": 208440,
      "text": "有意义吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 208440,
      "end_ms": 211360,
      "text": "都是全都是短板的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 211360,
      "end_ms": 213640,
      "text": "没有任何用吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 213889,
      "end_ms": 216449,
      "text": "啊首先你做工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 216449,
      "end_ms": 218849,
      "text": "首先你要做他短板少"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 218849,
      "end_ms": 220149,
      "text": "只有一两个短板"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 220149,
      "end_ms": 223560,
      "text": "绝大部分是还有一些长处的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 223560,
      "end_ms": 227270,
      "text": "这些人的工作完全平庸的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 227270,
      "end_ms": 228150,
      "text": "无知的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 228150,
      "end_ms": 229130,
      "text": "懦弱的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 229130,
      "end_ms": 230090,
      "text": "愚蠢的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 230090,
      "end_ms": 231410,
      "text": "卑劣的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 231410,
      "end_ms": 233340,
      "text": "充满了问题的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 233340,
      "end_ms": 234460,
      "text": "帮了也没用啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 235580,
      "end_ms": 237360,
      "text": "帮了自己陷在泥潭里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 237360,
      "end_ms": 238820,
      "text": "浪费自己的资源"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 238820,
      "end_ms": 240870,
      "text": "时间精力活动空间"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 240870,
      "end_ms": 242450,
      "text": "弄一堆这种魔怔人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 242450,
      "end_ms": 243730,
      "text": "病理化的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 243730,
      "end_ms": 245390,
      "text": "毫无能力的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 245390,
      "end_ms": 248110,
      "text": "毫无提供不了任何帮助"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 248110,
      "end_ms": 252070,
      "text": "还需要不停地吸取你的帮助的这些人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 253320,
      "end_ms": 255320,
      "text": "你弄一个两个千金市马骨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 255320,
      "end_ms": 257959,
      "text": "我倒是可以理解啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 257959,
      "end_ms": 261279,
      "text": "啊人望之却为震朔所在啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 261279,
      "end_ms": 264699,
      "text": "呵呵弄多了有啥意思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 265140,
      "end_ms": 266960,
      "text": "一个两个弄得装逼啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 266960,
      "end_ms": 269340,
      "text": "正朔朔所在也是搞笑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 269340,
      "end_ms": 272180,
      "text": "我靠这说这那这有傻子大"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 272180,
      "end_ms": 273960,
      "text": "大家赶紧过来薅他羊毛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 273960,
      "end_ms": 274880,
      "text": "这个意思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 276080,
      "end_ms": 278260,
      "text": "如果短板太多的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 278620,
      "end_ms": 280220,
      "text": "实事求是讲啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 280220,
      "end_ms": 282409,
      "text": "他这个德不配位啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 282409,
      "end_ms": 285009,
      "text": "在这里应当是一个发展的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 285009,
      "end_ms": 288530,
      "text": "应当是一个进步的一些空间"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 288530,
      "end_ms": 290530,
      "text": "竟然被很明显"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 290530,
      "end_ms": 294550,
      "text": "要把自己历史的最为宝贵的资源给浪费的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 294550,
      "end_ms": 298260,
      "text": "耗尽的不应当如此"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 298260,
      "end_ms": 302100,
      "text": "而机体的新陈代谢是一直要去维持的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 302100,
      "end_ms": 303040,
      "text": "你不能说哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 303040,
      "end_ms": 304700,
      "text": "他是老兄弟"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 304700,
      "end_ms": 305560,
      "text": "认识的比较早"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 305560,
      "end_ms": 307700,
      "text": "什么什么东西的要淘汰的呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 307700,
      "end_ms": 309220,
      "text": "该淘汰的要淘汰"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 309220,
      "end_ms": 311780,
      "text": "否则就是对历史不负责任"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 312590,
      "end_ms": 314410,
      "text": "怎么能对历史不负责任呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 314410,
      "end_ms": 317070,
      "text": "历史给予的机会是非常有限的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 317070,
      "end_ms": 318740,
      "text": "这很魔怔"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 318740,
      "end_ms": 319740,
      "text": "去基进化的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 319740,
      "end_ms": 322100,
      "text": "做不到正儿八经的干活"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 322100,
      "end_ms": 323000,
      "text": "干不了几天"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 323000,
      "end_ms": 325140,
      "text": "不停的去撂挑子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 325140,
      "end_ms": 327500,
      "text": "不停的去发病的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 328269,
      "end_ms": 329949,
      "text": "历史给予我们的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 329949,
      "end_ms": 333749,
      "text": "或者是说很宝贵的这些点点滴滴"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 333749,
      "end_ms": 334769,
      "text": "所有人的努力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 334769,
      "end_ms": 342980,
      "text": "整个国家民族还有这个特定的穷苦阶级啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 342980,
      "end_ms": 345200,
      "text": "这积攒下来的这些希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 345200,
      "end_ms": 347540,
      "text": "难道就被你白白浪费了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 347540,
      "end_ms": 349210,
      "text": "凭什么呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 349570,
      "end_ms": 351690,
      "text": "所以该清退的要清退"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 351690,
      "end_ms": 356080,
      "text": "然后呢该寻找嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 356080,
      "end_ms": 358960,
      "text": "就是它本身很好改造"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 359860,
      "end_ms": 361100,
      "text": "一定的锻炼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 361100,
      "end_ms": 363980,
      "text": "有限的锻炼就能够获得十足的成长的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 363980,
      "end_ms": 367830,
      "text": "这些人要首先做他们的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 368070,
      "end_ms": 370330,
      "text": "也就是说首先做自己人的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 370330,
      "end_ms": 372110,
      "text": "首先做合格的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 372110,
      "end_ms": 373390,
      "text": "容易合格的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 373390,
      "end_ms": 376560,
      "text": "有待成为自己人的自己人的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 376800,
      "end_ms": 379840,
      "text": "那么群众工作这种情况下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 379840,
      "end_ms": 383870,
      "text": "群众工作是一个是一个中介"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 384260,
      "end_ms": 386100,
      "text": "群众工作只是一个锻炼的机会"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 386100,
      "end_ms": 387680,
      "text": "你一下子能做多少群众啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 387680,
      "end_ms": 389920,
      "text": "14亿群众"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 389920,
      "end_ms": 391560,
      "text": "你能做多少群众"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 391560,
      "end_ms": 393700,
      "text": "13亿多群众"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 396360,
      "end_ms": 399580,
      "text": "谁又和你又没有非常直接的利益关联"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 399580,
      "end_ms": 400920,
      "text": "做了做来做去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 400920,
      "end_ms": 402430,
      "text": "这就花钱了事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 402430,
      "end_ms": 405390,
      "text": "花点说的是不是个赚点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 405390,
      "end_ms": 408570,
      "text": "说的事是可以锻炼他们的经经验啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 408570,
      "end_ms": 412749,
      "text": "是可以让这些人成长提高啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 412749,
      "end_ms": 416169,
      "text": "或者说内心更加坚定啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 416169,
      "end_ms": 418349,
      "text": "做事情更讲究方法和策略"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 418349,
      "end_ms": 424210,
      "text": "但是呢首先要做的不是说要练这些人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 424210,
      "end_ms": 425770,
      "text": "锻炼自己的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 425770,
      "end_ms": 427990,
      "text": "首先你要说要有自己的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 427990,
      "end_ms": 431030,
      "text": "要有本来不太合格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 431030,
      "end_ms": 432470,
      "text": "差一点点合格的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 432470,
      "end_ms": 435350,
      "text": "让他变成合格的自己人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 436040,
      "end_ms": 436720,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 436720,
      "end_ms": 439080,
      "text": "所以首要的不是做所谓的群众工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 439080,
      "end_ms": 440580,
      "text": "做来做去啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 440580,
      "end_ms": 443120,
      "text": "然后打这个群众工作的幌子是谁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 443120,
      "end_ms": 444780,
      "text": "但凡只要做了点群众工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 444780,
      "end_ms": 446780,
      "text": "你就要拉他入伙吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 446919,
      "end_ms": 448439,
      "text": "你要带她玩吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 448439,
      "end_ms": 451239,
      "text": "你不被道德绑架了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 451480,
      "end_ms": 453260,
      "text": "你还有你自己的门槛吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 453260,
      "end_ms": 456760,
      "text": "你还想不想就是说在能力适配啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 456760,
      "end_ms": 460300,
      "text": "在意识形态适配在这个正儿八经啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 460300,
      "end_ms": 463260,
      "text": "就是分工协作的前提条件下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 463260,
      "end_ms": 464260,
      "text": "把你的事情做成"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 464260,
      "end_ms": 466730,
      "text": "还是就是任由这些人胡作非为"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 466730,
      "end_ms": 468150,
      "text": "不叫胡作非为"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 468150,
      "end_ms": 471770,
      "text": "他就是用他的一点点所作所为就可以绑架你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 471770,
      "end_ms": 473330,
      "text": "无无纪律"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 474420,
      "end_ms": 476420,
      "text": "你们到底想不想把事情做成"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 477620,
      "end_ms": 479020,
      "text": "如果是想把事情做成"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 479020,
      "end_ms": 481400,
      "text": "那就要讲组织学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 481400,
      "end_ms": 484000,
      "text": "那就要讲实事求是讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 484000,
      "end_ms": 487380,
      "text": "就要讲要德位相符"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 488720,
      "end_ms": 491480,
      "text": "能者居上啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 491800,
      "end_ms": 495080,
      "text": "但是是在平等的大前提下的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 495080,
      "end_ms": 496040,
      "text": "能者居上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 496040,
      "end_ms": 499629,
      "text": "这个上就是说优先去承担更重要的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 499629,
      "end_ms": 502849,
      "text": "优先去承担能力更适配的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 503560,
      "end_ms": 506720,
      "text": "这天然就会啊在不同的岗位上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 506720,
      "end_ms": 512240,
      "text": "在不同的这个负责的这个方向上区分开来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 513600,
      "end_ms": 518489,
      "text": "可能局部一些小的概率的情况之下呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 518489,
      "end_ms": 521009,
      "text": "比如说像我我有的时候像啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 521009,
      "end_ms": 522609,
      "text": "不能就是太特异化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 522609,
      "end_ms": 525150,
      "text": "不能就是太我去均衡一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 525150,
      "end_ms": 525890,
      "text": "稍微均衡一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 525890,
      "end_ms": 529290,
      "text": "但是大的方向上我不会改变它的趋势"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 529610,
      "end_ms": 532350,
      "text": "大的方向上我是不会改变这一趋势的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 532350,
      "end_ms": 533550,
      "text": "那绝大部分人呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 533550,
      "end_ms": 536610,
      "text": "就是其他能力都只能勉勉强合格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 536610,
      "end_ms": 537870,
      "text": "有两三项能力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 537870,
      "end_ms": 539570,
      "text": "我这是我可以容忍的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 539570,
      "end_ms": 542050,
      "text": "那我可以把短板补齐啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 542050,
      "end_ms": 543330,
      "text": "只要稍微有点耐心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 543330,
      "end_ms": 546370,
      "text": "但是你如果说一半的能力都是短板"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 546370,
      "end_ms": 548370,
      "text": "一半的心性素养方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 548370,
      "end_ms": 549690,
      "text": "一半的这个生活习惯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 549690,
      "end_ms": 551500,
      "text": "心理习惯方面全是坑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 551500,
      "end_ms": 553780,
      "text": "那是没有办法的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 554330,
      "end_ms": 556190,
      "text": "那是没有办法的好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 556190,
      "end_ms": 557770,
      "text": "所以我再强调一遍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 557770,
      "end_ms": 560370,
      "text": "首先不是做群众工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 561810,
      "end_ms": 564250,
      "text": "啊首先做的是什么工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 564250,
      "end_ms": 569530,
      "text": "是你这个群体内部的人才的权重的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 570050,
      "end_ms": 572050,
      "text": "要协调好人才的权重"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 572050,
      "end_ms": 576310,
      "text": "各方面都能够有相应的合适的人去负责"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 576890,
      "end_ms": 579190,
      "text": "然后做这个工作的一个最重要的内核"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 579190,
      "end_ms": 581390,
      "text": "是要有足够的合格的人手"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 581390,
      "end_ms": 582210,
      "text": "合格的人手"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 582210,
      "end_ms": 584610,
      "text": "那就是说你直接完全合格的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 584610,
      "end_ms": 585090,
      "text": "不可能啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 585090,
      "end_ms": 586170,
      "text": "他直接去职场了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 586170,
      "end_ms": 586870,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 586870,
      "end_ms": 591320,
      "text": "相对合格的这些人那个有这么个简单方法给它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 591320,
      "end_ms": 592180,
      "text": "像是这样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 592180,
      "end_ms": 594320,
      "text": "就像我们卖的M250显卡一样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 594320,
      "end_ms": 595420,
      "text": "稍微给他调一调"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 595420,
      "end_ms": 596600,
      "text": "它就能用了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 596600,
      "end_ms": 597700,
      "text": "性能还很好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 597700,
      "end_ms": 599220,
      "text": "其他还有很大的长处"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 599220,
      "end_ms": 603569,
      "text": "这么一个比较朴素的思路行吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 603569,
      "end_ms": 607289,
      "text": "你说哈第一步就要做群众工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 608210,
      "end_ms": 611530,
      "text": "你把现在这个泥泞中汪洋大海里"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 611530,
      "end_ms": 612510,
      "text": "把自己献没了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 612510,
      "end_ms": 615760,
      "text": "溶解掉了好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 616080,
      "end_ms": 617960,
      "text": "什么什么准备都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 617960,
      "end_ms": 622040,
      "text": "什么样的就是不可溶解性都没有的情况之下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 622890,
      "end_ms": 624090,
      "text": "都去做群众工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 624090,
      "end_ms": 625210,
      "text": "那你回回老家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 625210,
      "end_ms": 626650,
      "text": "回高老庄一样有什么区别"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 626650,
      "end_ms": 627410,
      "text": "这是逃避"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 627410,
      "end_ms": 630130,
      "text": "这实际上是在逃避工作呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 630130,
      "end_ms": 633790,
      "text": "逃避这个专门的职业的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 633790,
      "end_ms": 636170,
      "text": "然后协作的分工的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 636170,
      "end_ms": 637450,
      "text": "彼此信任的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 637450,
      "end_ms": 640780,
      "text": "有纪律的工作啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 640780,
      "end_ms": 643420,
      "text": "去用用所谓的浪漫主义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 643420,
      "end_ms": 644920,
      "text": "道德主义的哈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 644920,
      "end_ms": 649190,
      "text": "奉献自我感动的所谓的群群众工作来逃避"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 649190,
      "end_ms": 650790,
      "text": "刚刚更为繁重的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 650790,
      "end_ms": 654570,
      "text": "其实更为有利于群众长远利益的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 654570,
      "end_ms": 656160,
      "text": "逃避这些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 656160,
      "end_ms": 658820,
      "text": "那这样是一种投降主义啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 658820,
      "end_ms": 659920,
      "text": "是一种投降主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 659920,
      "end_ms": 665090,
      "text": "投降在内心的道德情感层面的些微的安定当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 665090,
      "end_ms": 668710,
      "text": "那么这是被小三爷里的文化啊给收买"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 668710,
      "end_ms": 670770,
      "text": "道德主义文化给收买了的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 670770,
      "end_ms": 673430,
      "text": "那么从精神层面就可以说是某种叛徒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 673430,
      "end_ms": 675370,
      "text": "虽然他看上去好像他最没有背叛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 675370,
      "end_ms": 677440,
      "text": "实际上他已经是叛徒了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 677720,
      "end_ms": 678860,
      "text": "那就讲到这边"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 678860,
      "end_ms": 681260,
      "text": "不要盲目的做所谓的群众工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 681260,
      "end_ms": 684540,
      "text": "群众工作是在你的团队是相对已经比较成熟的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 684540,
      "end_ms": 687000,
      "text": "通过群众工作是让你的能力是提升的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 687000,
      "end_ms": 688940,
      "text": "但是能力提升的前提是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 688940,
      "end_ms": 691580,
      "text": "你这些人本身能力是合格的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 691580,
      "end_ms": 692460,
      "text": "能力不合格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 692460,
      "end_ms": 693340,
      "text": "我让你提升干什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 693340,
      "end_ms": 695890,
      "text": "你滚能力不合格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
